data: {"action_id":"8ebde0fc-b8b8-4a64-99cd-c6916697da59","version":1,"action_type":"send_letter","title":"Send Missing Documents Notice to PrimeValue Mart Pte Ltd","payload":{"kind":"letter","draft_id":"f56fac29-1f9e-41f5-a9fa-f615988e88a8","template_id":"TPL-DOC-02","template_title":"Missing Documents Notice","template_version":"1.3","recipient":"PrimeValue Mart Pte Ltd","slots":{"letter_date":"13 November 2026","tenant_name":"PrimeValue Mart Pte Ltd","contact_person":"Nur Aisyah binte Kamal","application_id":"APP-2026-0288","application_type":"RENEWAL","unit_address":"Blk 667 Jalan Pasir Indah #01-02 Singapura 510667","missing_documents_list":"- Valid public liability insurance certificate covering the new term: The cover ends on 13 July 2027, before the new term starts on 1 August 2027.\n- GIRO authorisation form (only if bank account changed): The scan can't be read, so it counts as not submitted.","submit_by_date":"27 November 2026","officer_name":"Siti Aishah Yusof","officer_email":"siti.aishah@heb.example.org"},"unfilled":[{"slot":"letter_ref","reason":"PLG Records hold no letter reference: give one before sending."}],"pii":[]},"preview":"<p>Our ref: <mark>«letter_ref»</mark></p>\n<p>13 November 2026</p>\n<p>PrimeValue Mart Pte Ltd<br>Attn: Nur Aisyah binte Kamal</p>\n<p>Dear Nur Aisyah binte Kamal,</p>\n<p>RENEWAL APPLICATION APP-2026-0288 - OUTSTANDING DOCUMENTS (Blk 667 Jalan Pasir Indah #01-02 Singapura 510667)</p>\n<p>Thank you for your application. We have reviewed the documents you submitted and need the following before we can continue:</p>\n<p>- Valid public liability insurance certificate covering the new term: The cover ends on 13 July 2027, before the new term starts on 1 August 2027.<br>- GIRO authorisation form (only if bank account changed): The scan can&#x27;t be read, so it counts as not submitted.</p>\n<p>Please submit the documents by 27 November 2026 (14 days from the date of this letter) via email to siti.aishah@heb.example.org or at any HEB branch. Your application will be treated as withdrawn if we do not receive them by this date.</p>\n<p>Yours sincerely,</p>\n<p>Siti Aishah Yusof</p>\n<p>Tenancy Management</p>\n<p>Properties &amp; Land Group</p>","approver_roles":["officer","estate_manager","manager","director","legal"],"proposed_by":"S05","proposed_at":"2026-11-13T10:46:36.575929+00:00","status":"pending","type":"proposed_action","seq":42}

